00:49:58,790 --> 00:50:00,201
I do not know.

824
00:50:00,225 --> 00:50:02,205
Shizuka, come and play with me.

825
00:50:02,227 --> 00:50:06,073
I rent a room and you
can also come with others.

826
00:50:08,933 --> 00:50:10,708
She does not believe

827
00:50:10,735 --> 00:50:12,578
I think so.

828
00:50:12,604 --> 00:50:14,083
Somebody is talking outside.

829
00:50:14,105 --> 00:50:15,140
Seemingly coming

830
00:50:16,774 --> 00:50:18,276
Load it on

831
00:50:18,309 --> 00:50:20,585
I told you all. There is no
more room number here.

832
00:50:22,780 --> 00:50:25,886
But in telephone
they do say there is room number.

833
00:50:25,917 --> 00:50:28,488
I am the landlord
of this apartment building

834
00:50:28,520 --> 00:50:29,260
If I say no, there is no more.

835
00:50:29,287 --> 00:50:33,167
What room number? Not lucky
Go back, go back.

836
00:50:33,191 --> 00:50:34,727
I do feel strange.

837
00:50:34,759 --> 00:50:37,399
He likes big mouth.

838
00:50:37,428 --> 00:50:39,533
Next time when I see him
I will beat him heavily.

839
00:50:40,899 --> 00:50:43,095
Call them from this side.

840
00:50:43,101 --> 00:50:45,172
Hi, wait.

841
00:50:45,203 --> 00:50:46,580
Shizuka

842
00:50:46,604 --> 00:50:48,845
Gian, wait

843
00:50:48,873 --> 00:50:50,409
Mom

844
00:50:50,441 --> 00:50:52,114
Run

845
00:50:52,110 --> 00:50:55,114
Run, fast

846
00:50:55,113 --> 00:50:58,890
That kid runs away as soon
he sees me. How come?

847
00:51:00,351 --> 00:51:03,821
Please, does it work
if you do nothing like that?

848
00:51:03,855 --> 00:51:07,029
Lots of homework to be done.

849
00:51:07,125 --> 00:51:10,595
Although I know it won't
work if not write them

850
00:51:10,628 --> 00:51:13,472
But I get used to be
criticized by mom and then write them.

851
00:51:13,498 --> 00:51:17,207
No criticize, not homework, right?

852
00:51:17,235 --> 00:51:18,839
What's the matter?

853
00:51:18,870 --> 00:51:20,850
I think of that.

854
00:51:24,475 --> 00:51:26,284
Which one?

855
00:51:26,311 --> 00:51:28,052
It's Nobita

856
00:51:28,146 --> 00:51:31,423
You can't just play around
go and do the homework.

857
00:51:31,449 --> 00:51:32,985
Nobita, where do you go?

858
00:51:33,017 --> 00:51:35,224
Come back for homework.

859
00:51:37,956 --> 00:51:40,027
Finally starts writing

860
00:51:44,963 --> 00:51:46,965
Nobita, I have to be back.

861
00:51:46,998 --> 00:51:49,308
Ordered cake is coming.

862
00:51:54,973 --> 00:51:57,886
I seem to be hungry.

863
00:52:01,646 --> 00:52:04,718
If eaten up all the breds
brought here

864
00:52:04,749 --> 00:52:07,457
We have to make food
for us own. That would be a problem.

865
00:52:07,485 --> 00:52:08,589
Very hot...

866
00:52:08,620 --> 00:52:10,531
Hot, hot

867
00:52:11,656 --> 00:52:14,364
You have to wash your own cloths

868
00:52:24,135 --> 00:52:27,139
Hi, turn down the volume of your radio.

869
00:52:27,171 --> 00:52:30,778
What's this?
Disturbed your family.

870
00:52:30,808 --> 00:52:33,288
That's right. Our kids
can't sleep.

871
00:52:33,311 --> 00:52:36,622
Very sorry, we
don't have any radio.

872
00:52:36,648 --> 00:52:39,595
Noisy apartment

873
00:52:48,559 --> 00:52:52,268
Mom has not realized
I let home.

874
00:52:53,931 --> 00:52:56,309
Or is looking for me now.

875
00:52:56,334 --> 00:52:59,440
But if I am here, it would
be very difficult to find me.

876
00:53:00,171 --> 00:53:03,880
Right, you'd better move to
where your mom can easily find you.

877
00:53:09,213 --> 00:53:11,113
Really very busy

878
00:53:11,115 --> 00:53:11,957
<i>Bus'!</i>

879
00:53:11,983 --> 00:53:14,623
Mom has even not realized my leaving.

880
00:53:14,652 --> 00:53:18,532
Its' terrible for kids
having this kind of parents.

881
00:53:18,556 --> 00:53:20,729
Hm, always feel right.

882
00:53:20,758 --> 00:53:22,931
Become independent
it seems too early.

883
00:53:41,846 --> 00:53:46,261
Somebody's face is round

884
00:53:46,284 --> 00:53:51,199
Somebody's face is long

885
00:53:51,222 --> 00:53:56,001
Somebody's face is square

886
00:53:56,094 --> 00:54:00,839
Somebody's face is triangle

887
00:54:00,865 --> 00:54:05,678
If cry, become angry
play temper

888
00:54:05,703 --> 00:54:10,516
Crying one will become an devil.

889
00:54:10,541 --> 00:54:15,354
But be happy and laugh.

890
00:54:15,380 --> 00:54:19,851
Everybody's face is actually round.

